{"language":"cn","values":[["/skills/0/name_i18n/cn","无赦秘仪"],["/skills/0/simple_description_i18n/cn","召唤法阵，点亮后会给周围敌我双方施加效果。所有法阵均被点亮时施放全场法阵。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，奎茵在战场上召唤4个法阵，每个法阵累计获得1000能量后会被点亮。法阵被点亮后，使周围2格内所有友军每秒回复奎茵40% + 8% ATK的生命值、所有敌军降低30 + 5点急速。\n主动释放时，奎茵消耗自身的能量给目标法阵充能直到它被点亮。若所有法阵均被点亮，将法阵的影响范围扩大到全场，同时降低全场敌人30% + 3%的基础属性并将其平均转移给我方角色，持续10秒；每名我方角色获得的转移属性上限为奎茵对应初始属性的45%（在挑战首领的模式中，改为固定达到该上限）。"],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":65,"end":70,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":87,"end":91,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"},{"start":160,"end":165,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg2"}]],["/skills/0/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":62,"end":74,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":166,"end":170,"tooltip_key":"keyword:basicattr"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵50% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至35 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵60% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至40 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵70% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至45 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，友军每秒回复的生命值提升至奎茵80% + 8% ATK、敌军降低的急速提升至50 + 5点。"],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":25,"end":30,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":47,"end":51,"power_type":"ultimate","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/0/variants/4/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":34,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/1/name_i18n/cn","缚孽锁链"],["/skills/1/simple_description_i18n/cn","定身输出最高的敌人并降低其属性。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","将此时累计输出最高的敌人定身，并降低目标50 + 10点急速、45% + 6%护甲和魔抗，持续5秒。场上每存在1个已点亮的法阵，持续时间延长0.5秒。"],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":22,"end":27,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":34,"end":39,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":12,"end":14,"tooltip_key":"keyword:immobilize"}]],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至55 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至50% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至60 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至55% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","降低的急速提升至70 + 10点，降低的护甲和魔抗提升至60% + 6%。"],["/skills/1/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":10,"end":15,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"},{"start":31,"end":36,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg1"}]],["/skills/2/name_i18n/cn","柔泽始降"],["/skills/2/simple_description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时点亮一个法阵。法阵会不断通过敌人的属性降低效果充能。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗开始时，若奎茵站在法阵上，则点亮脚下的法阵，否则点亮距离自身布阵位置最远的法阵。\n被动地，所有法阵每3秒根据2格内的敌人拥有属性降低效果的数量充能，每有1个来自不同友军的属性降低效果，法阵回复24 + 4点能量。"],["/skills/2/variants/0/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":100,"end":104,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至26 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/1/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至28 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/2/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","法阵每次回复的能量提升至32 + 4。"],["/skills/2/variants/3/description_power_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":14,"end":18,"power_type":"skill","parameter":"SArg0"}]],["/skills/3/name_i18n/cn","英雄专精"],["/skills/3/simple_description_i18n/cn","提高自身急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高12点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高3点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高15点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高4点急速。"],["/skills/3/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中，自身提高18点急速，所有法阵均被点亮后额外提高5点急速。"],["/skills/4/name_i18n/cn","恩典裁决"],["/skills/4/simple_description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后对最虚弱的单位施加效果。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","法阵被点亮后，选择其2格范围内最虚弱的单位发射波纹，若目标为友方，则使其获得奎茵500% ATK的护盾，持续8秒，否则对其造成奎茵300% ATK的伤害。\n每有1个已点亮的法阵，额外使此技能施加的护盾和伤害效果增强10%。"],["/skills/4/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":15,"end":19,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"},{"start":40,"end":48,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"},{"start":65,"end":73,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_i18n/cn","“恩典裁决”使友方获得的护盾值提升至奎茵550% ATK、敌方受到的伤害提升至350%。"],["/skills/4/variants/1/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_i18n/cn","战斗中每10秒，所有已点亮的法阵对场上最虚弱的单位再次发射波纹。"],["/skills/4/variants/2/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":19,"end":23,"tooltip_key":"keyword:weakest"}]],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_i18n/cn","“恩典裁决”使友方获得的护盾值提升至奎茵600% ATK、敌方受到的伤害提升至400%。"],["/skills/4/variants/3/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":20,"end":28,"tooltip_key":"stat:ATK"}]],["/skills/5/name_i18n/cn","觉醒之力"],["/skills/5/simple_description_i18n/cn","使\"无赦秘仪\"施放的全场法阵持续到战斗结束，每次施放额外使友方获得霸体和伤害提高。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_i18n/cn","当所有法阵均被点亮后，使\"无赦秘仪\"将法阵范围扩大到全场的效果持续到战斗结束，且后续施放时使所有友方单位进入霸体状态，且造成伤害提高5%，持续5秒。"],["/skills/5/variants/0/description_tooltip_spans_i18n/cn",[{"start":54,"end":56,"tooltip_key":"keyword:uncontrol"}]],["/exclusive_equipment/name_i18n/cn","寂灭裁杖"]]}